              <name>INTID</name>
              <description>Interrupt ID (Write Only)\nWrite to the STIR To Generate An Interrupt from Software\nWhen the USERSETMPEND bit in the CCR is set to 1, unprivileged software can access the STIR.\nNumber of valid Interrupt ID refers to Table 6.29. For example, a value of 0x03 specifies interrupt IRQ3.</description>
