            <field>
              <name>CRLIFOV0</name>
              <description>Capture Rising Latch Interrupt Flag Overrun Status (Read Only)\nThis flag indicates if rising latch happened when the corresponding CRLIFn(EPWM_CAPIF[n]) is 1.\nNote: This bit will be cleared automatically when user clears corresponding CRLIFn(EPWM_CAPIF[n]).</description>
