          <fields>
            <field>
              <name>RDTEN0</name>
              <description>Enable Rising Dead-time Insertion for EPWM Pair (Write Protect)\nRising Dead-time insertion is only active when this pair of complementary EPWM is enabled. If rising dead- time insertion is inactive, the outputs of pin pair are complementary without any delay.\nNote: This bit is write protected. Refer to SYS_REGLCTL register.</description>
