            <field>
              <name>PUSEL1</name>
              <description>I/O Pull-up and Pull-down Enable Bits\nDetermine PF.5 I/O pull-up or pull-down.\nNote: Basically, the pull-up control and pull-down control has following behavior limitation.\nThe independent pull-up / pull-down control register is only valid when OPMODE1 is set as input tri-state and open-drain mode.</description>
